 ("What is the best trailer hitch for a 2023+ Honda CR-V?",
  "For most owners, the CURT 13397. It's a Class 3 hitch with a 2 in receiver, rated 3,500 lb gross trailer weight and 525 lb tongue weight, and CURT lists it for the 2017–2026 CR-V. etrailer lists it at $176.81 and an etrailer expert says it fits every CR-V, hybrids included. It costs less than half of Honda's accessory hitch and takes the far wider choice of 2 in bike racks and carriers."),
